Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:01:15.00,Accent,,0,0,0,,parse → validate → allocate → instantiate → register
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:01:15.00,Body,,0,0,0,,StarryOS VM 1   2 vCPU · 256 MiB · virtio-blk · virtio-net\NZephyr VM 2    1 vCPU · 64 MiB  · virtio-net\N\NStarry block  MMIO 0xb000000 · INTID 32\NStarry net    MMIO 0xb001000 · INTID 34\NZephyr net    MMIO 0xb000000 · INTID 32\N\N地址、中断、后端和 CPU mask 在构建前 fail closed 校验。
